 ignores safety.","Use a put-down and call it honesty.","Treating health as only sport fitness, or proposing unsafe “fixes.”","Name a body cue, safety rule or wellbeing strategy and say how it helps with health dimensions."],"question":"Which evidence move best supports a claim about health dimensions?","type":"multiple_choice"},{"correct_index":2,"explanation":"The stronger choice matches the taught idea with concrete detail. The other choices miss a key step or use a common mistake.","options":["Choose the fastest option even when it ignores safety.","Use a put-down and call it honesty.","Example: Poor sleep (physical) → irritability (mental/emotional) → arguments with teammates (social).","Treating health as only sport fitness, or proposing unsafe “fixes.”"],"question":"Using this lesson idea — Health has interconnected dimensions (commonly physical, mental/emotional, social, and sometimes — which choice is best?","type":"multiple_choice"},{"correct_index":2,"explanation":"Accuracy means checking evidence and honouring limits or protocols. The other choices miss a key step or use a common mistake.","options":["Ignore safety or cultural protocols to finish faster.","Treat every claim as equally reliable without checking a source or cue.","Check safety and fairness, include others, and explain the healthier choice.","Invent missing details to make the answer sound complete."],"question":"Which action keeps safe, healthy or respectful choices accurate for health dimensions?","type":"multiple_choice"},{"correct_index":2,"explanation":"Independence requires a new example that still uses the taught skill. The other choices miss a key step or use a common mistake.","options":["Treating health as only sport fitness, or proposing unsafe “fixes.”","Name physical only, with no linked example.","Independently analyse two scenarios for dimensional links and write a balanced wellbeing recommendation for each.","Retype the worked example with no new example."],"question":"Which independent response best applies health dimensions to new material?","type":"multiple_choice"},{"explanation":"Independent evidence on new material demonstrates the skill; copying the model does not.","marking_guide":"Accept original work about health dimensions with a specific supporting detail. Reject copied model wording with no new material.","question":"Produce a fresh example demonstrating health dimensions on new material (not the worked model). Explain the particular words, sources or choices that make it work.","sample_answer":"Sample: original example using health dimensions on new material; names a specific word, source or choice and explains its effect.","type":"short_answer"},{"explanation":"A useful correction changes the inaccurate idea or method and explains why.","marking_guide":"Accept a misconception, a correction, and a purpose-linked reason for health dimensions. Reject corrections that do not change the inaccurate idea.","question":"Name one likely error with health dimensions, correct it, and explain why the correction helps a reader or audience.","sample_answer":"Sample error: Treating health as only sport fitness, or proposing unsafe “fixes.”. Correction: Strong answer: dimensions named accurately;. Why it helps the audience is stated.","type":"short_answer"}],"resources":null,"response_prompt":"Include your independent evidence and reflection, with reasons where requested. Share only what you feel comfortable sharing.","review_status":"unreviewed","seed_key":"s4-pdhpe-y7-w02-l1","sort_activity":null,"source_note":"Proposed Stage 2 NESA PDHPE alignment using catalogue outcome codes (PH2-*); content-point mapping remains pending human review. Physical activities are optional, adult-supervised and adaptable; no child is required to share personal details.","spelling":null,"spelling_focus":null,"stage":"S4","stage_hints":{"accept":["Today you will practise health dimensions.","Read the mission before you start moving or deciding.","Keep your 